## 🚀 How to Run the Applications

### 1. Backend Server (Port 5002)
```bash
cd backend

# Development Mode (loads .env.development):
npm run dev

# Production Mode (loads .env.production):
npm run prod
# or: npm start
```

### 2. User / Player Portal (`user/` folder)
```bash
cd user

# Development Mode (connects to local API http://localhost:5002):
npm run dev

# Build for Production (uses .env.production):
npm run build:prod
```

### 3. Admin Panel (`panel/` / `frontend/` folder)
```bash
cd panel

# Development Mode (connects to local API http://localhost:5002):
npm run dev

# Build for Production (uses .env.production):
npm run build:prod
```

---

## ⚙️ How to Seed / Create All in Database

Terminal mein `backend` folder ke andar se ek single command chalayein:

```bash
cd backend
node seed/seedAllRoles.js
```




